sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Causes page
    participant CC as Causes Controller
    participant CA as SQL table: causes

    Admin->>UI: Open causes management page
    UI->>CC: Request causes with default filters
    CC->>CA: Read active causes
    CA-->>CC: Cause rows
    CC-->>UI: Cause list
    UI-->>Admin: Display causes table and actions

    opt Search or include inactive causes
        Admin->>UI: Change filter/search
        UI->>CC: Request filtered causes
        CC->>CA: Select causes by filters
        CA-->>CC: Filtered rows
        CC-->>UI: Filtered cause list
        UI-->>Admin: Refresh table
    end

    note over UI: View, create and delete/deactivate are extension flows.
